Acceptance criteria
-------------------
No slider, track or switch label remains on the front face. The physical
assembly faces outward from the lower edge within the shell thickness.
Its accessible target follows the cap, remains at least44px, stays clear of
the LCD and works at desktop/landscape/phone sizes. On/off travel is retained.
The same real power lifecycle preserves saves and cold-boots a fresh runtime.
No unrelated camera, console size, emulation, lighting or fullscreen changes.

